{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0264_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4dcba30e499c6d20feb074c69b61a54e973b658fd2468991cd13a3eb67f2a8ce", "ja": "お疲れ様、雪歩。\n新しい衣装、試着してみてどうだ？", "zh": "辛苦了，雪步。\n试穿新服装感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0264_1001_004yuk", "source_sha256": "b4e5b4335405cf2394628017c587ae6d52aa3ff99fd08cb4905f58d32348598c", "ja": "{$P$}！\nあの……あの、私、衣装に着られてませんか？", "zh": "{$P$}！\n那个……那个，我穿这件服装，会不会显得像被衣服穿了一样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0264_1002_004yuk", "source_sha256": "4a3fb641b1465679d64b04cacc4a4fe21577a829b1118264a9e189434edfc86d", "ja": "とっても素敵な衣装で……ううん、素敵すぎて、\n私なんかが着てよかったのかなって……ううっ。", "zh": "这么漂亮的服装……不，实在是太漂亮了，\n让我这种人穿真的没问题吗……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0264_1003_p", "source_sha256": "01d3c7fbfc393df24401c4bd6a448afc3690c8f68210fc9e927697847379e24c", "ja": "大丈夫。よく似合ってるよ。", "zh": "没事的，非常适合你哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0264_1004_004yuk", "source_sha256": "de180b611cac28559f7f414754c336b31f0d5b31c78048c9e4a25a21f48a3642", "ja": "本当ですか？　……えへへ♪\nでも、ちょっと不思議なことがあって……。", "zh": "真的吗？……嘿嘿♪\n不过，有件事让我觉得有点不可思议……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0264_1005_004yuk", "source_sha256": "4b819bf27251952ed352c9f7e26be8d01122656d340c2c153193b92f4e02f555", "ja": "この衣装を着てると、なんだか空が飛べそうで……\n頑張らなきゃって、やる気がわいてくるんです。", "zh": "穿着这身服装，总觉得自己好像能飞上天空……\n会涌起一股干劲，觉得自己必须努力才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0264_1006_p", "source_sha256": "00d8ceda4c15f4be9183ebecf39ddb1b4bcc42875a08c7795b697c98a3c511a0", "ja": "そうなのか。無意識で、衣装に負けたくないって、\n思ってるのかもしれないな。", "zh": "这样啊。说不定你是下意识地觉得，不能输给这身服装吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0264_1007_004yuk", "source_sha256": "dd09a6fa7fe7c907aa91de41629ffbda8e513329e49cfc2c702411457ef9dc57", "ja": "な、なるほど。この衣装を着こなせるようになれば、\n私も少し成長できるかも……？", "zh": "原、原来如此。要是能把这身服装穿出感觉来，我或许也能有所成长……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0264_1008_004yuk", "source_sha256": "6cba0578ede12277e368ccb78cd1eb815b2341343ac1b00ebc373212add00e30", "ja": "あの、{$P$}！\n衣装に負けないためには、どうしたらいいですか？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}！\n要想不输给服装，我该怎么做才好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0264_1009_p", "source_sha256": "375c9346434c69f3f0837e649b7af1dc5396f4fd8565a680965f0455ffae1743", "ja": "そうだな……例えば、イメトレをしてみるとか。\nその衣装で大活躍する自分の姿を思い浮かべるんだ。", "zh": "是啊……比如说，可以试着做做形象训练。\n想象一下自己穿着那套服装大显身手的样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0264_1010_004yuk", "source_sha256": "7be6b12dcc957b163b26d3b12bf39a194c91a40e268b832cb701cd3f9dcc7fa5", "ja": "大活躍する私を？　ええっと……それじゃ\nこの衣装で歌ってる姿をイメトレしてみますね！", "zh": "大展身手的我吗？那个……那我就\n在脑海中想象一下穿着这套服装唱歌的样子吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0264_1011_004yuk", "source_sha256": "a276efb6e9fb0f0675a2ab27b9da2f99af3dafa876f79cc588bce670e899be27", "ja": "……豪華なステージで、みんなと一緒に歌ってます。\nあ、客席は満員のお客さんで埋まってるみたいです。", "zh": "……在一座豪华的舞台上，正和大家一起歌唱。\n啊，观众席上好像坐满了观众。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0264_1012_p", "source_sha256": "afd2fb3206d0fccbef7f6b0c0689132a86da56eb63919049d91976966f516105", "ja": "そうか。大盛況じゃないか。", "zh": "这样啊。现场真是盛况空前啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0264_1013_004yuk", "source_sha256": "81c2f5f1a00260fc02ed463974e70033d5742170e5fdbe57714cc94d0c07a6eb", "ja": "あれ？　でも上の方にもお客さんがいる……。\nもしかして、劇場のステージじゃないのかなぁ？", "zh": "奇怪？不过上面的位置也有观众呢……\n难不成，这里不是剧场的舞台吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0264_1014_p", "source_sha256": "f2b169af88f6786d7f7f892091fa8a95a949587fbf1373dad98a341246b0e3c5", "ja": "ふむ、劇場じゃないならどこだ？\n雪歩は、何て言ってる？", "zh": "嗯，如果不是剧场，那会是哪里？\n雪步，她说了什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0264_1015_004yuk", "source_sha256": "16f6f658c98463995db69a46a52ab3ed2ec42bb7347317b5d18340de9589ca55", "ja": "えっと、「ドーム公演にきてくれてありがとうー」って\n私が叫んで……ええっ、ドーム公演！？", "zh": "呃，我喊着“谢谢你们来参加巨蛋公演——”……诶，巨蛋公演！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0264_1016_004yuk", "source_sha256": "6ee9fa59cadf05759ab62a4ba2406f4c8a434dea15d4658b810c460e609228f0", "ja": "{$P$}、無理です無理です！\nいきなりドームは、荷が重すぎますぅ～～～っ！！", "zh": "{$P$}，做不到，做不到！\n突然就要在巨蛋演出，负担也太重了～～～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0264_1017_p", "source_sha256": "b01e980273168074d8fa740edf9d9761779e3355ad1ea2c6fd543e0648d95dc8", "ja": "お、落ち着け、雪歩！\nまだ現実じゃないからな？", "zh": "噢、冷、冷静点，雪步！\n还、还没成为现实呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0264_1018_004yuk", "source_sha256": "a2bcede5fbd55dc2d5589209ad0f158a79e6c0ddac95e898674f6e6c24ebcda0", "ja": "そ、そっか。まだ現実じゃなかった……\nえっ、まだ？", "zh": "这、这样啊。还不是现实……\n诶，还不是？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0264_1019_p", "source_sha256": "1d783a6bca95dedd0bd91e84ff75ade9b7f2138356a335c280e1ae9275e8b756", "ja": "ああ。今は難しいかもしれないけど、\nいつかは現実にしたいと思ってる。", "zh": "嗯。现在或许还有点困难，\n但我想总有一天能让它成为现实。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0264_1020_004yuk", "source_sha256": "f858d9990436b0c367d0244fd50958631d44f201a7b8d058af496579c47b3bde", "ja": "{$P$}……。はい！　イメトレの中\nですけど、とっても楽しそうだなって思いました！", "zh": "{$P$}……嗯！虽然是在想象训练中，但我觉得一定会非常开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0264_1021_004yuk", "source_sha256": "0a5b96f21ff00147618f88986a0ccf7963c01addcfa64f9a8000b69582a4e0ee", "ja": "いつか、広い会場に飛び立つ日まで……。\nもっともっと成長できるように……私、頑張ります！", "zh": "为了等到有朝一日，能飞向广阔会场的那天……\n为了能让自己获得更多、更多的成长……我会努力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
